	(text "Development board: ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 compatible, ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 N8R2 or N16R2.\nGPIO35 to GPIO37 are free only on modules without octal PSRAM (R2 variants).\nMCU to carrier: series resistor here, then the logic device (Range Logic sheet).\nCarrier to MCU: U202, powered from the development board (+3V3_D).\nRequests have pull-downs; clock and data lines use the pull-ups of the logic device.\nJP201 open: each board is powered from its own USB connector."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
